==========================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)

{
  "expiresAt": REGEX(".*"),
  "id": "urn:ngsi-ld:Snapshot:S1",
  "lastUsedAt": REGEX(".*"),
  "snapshotPriority": 9,
  "snapshotQueries": [
    {
      "entities": [
        {
          "type": "Vehicle"
        }
      ],
      "type": "Query"
    }
  ],
  "snapshotQueriesDetails": [
    {
      "resultStatus": "success"
    }
  ],
  "snapshotStatus": "success",
  "type": "Snapshot"
}



05. PATCH /snapshots/S1 — try to mutate immutable id → 400
==========================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)

{
  "detail": "field 'id' cannot be modified via PATCH",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Immutable Field",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



06. PATCH /snapshots/S1 — try to mutate snapshotQueries → 400
=============================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)

{
  "detail": "field 'snapshotQueries' cannot be modified via PATCH",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Immutable Field",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



07. PATCH /snapshots/S1 — invalid priority 11 → 400
===================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)

{
  "detail": "'snapshotPriority' must be an integer between 1 and 10",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid Field Value",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



08. PATCH /snapshots/Unknown → 404
==================================
HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)

{
  "detail": "Snapshot 'urn:ngsi-ld:Snapshot:NoSuch' not found",
  "status": 404,
  "title": "Not Found",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/ResourceNotFound"
}



09. POST /snapshots/S1/clone (no body) → 201, server-generated id
=================================================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Location: /ngsi-ld/v1/snapshots/REGEX(urn:ngsi-ld:Snapshot:[0-9a-f]+:[0-9a-f]+)
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)




10. POST /snapshots/S1/clone with explicit id → 201
===================================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created
Date: REGEX(.*)
Location: /ngsi-ld/v1/snapshots/urn:ngsi-ld:Snapshot:S1Copy
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)




11. GET S1Copy → frozen entities visible via NGSILD-Snapshot
============================================================
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
NGSILD-Snapshot: urn:ngsi-ld:Snapshot:S1Copy
Link: <https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/v1/ngsi-ld-core-context-v1.9.jsonld>; rel="http://www.w3.org/ns/json-ld#context"; type="application/ld+json"
